{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11105100","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11105100","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1110510001:1":{"text":"Are you ready to face the final trial?","source_cn":"你们准备好迎接最后的试炼了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01A9101A00314791","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110510002:1":{"text":"Entrusted by the ancient will, I bring three riddles for you to solve before you may move forward.","source_cn":"我受古老的意志所托，为诸位带来三道谜题，猜出谜底方可前进。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5FF068C89CD9865","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110510003:1":{"text":"Just riddles? Sounds easy!","source_cn":"只是猜谜吗？那太棒了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD71E90DBE6551E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110510004:1":{"text":"Here's the first one!","source_cn":"第一道谜题——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6FB77B8644BD39C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110510005:1":{"text":"I grow stronger with time and experience. The more challenges I face, the more of me you gain. As I age, I become stronger. What am I?","source_cn":"我随时间和经验而增长，我遇到的挑战越多，你获得我的部分...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F4F47DAFB709098","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1110510005":{"text":"I grow stronger with time and experience. The more challenges I face, the more of me you gain. As I age, I become stronger. What am I?","source_cn":"我随时间和经验而增长，我遇到的挑战越多，你获得我的部分就越多。随着年龄的增长，我会变得更强大，我是什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F4F47DAFB709098","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110510006:1":{"text":"Hmm... But strength doesn't really grow with age, right? I think it's wisdom!","source_cn":"力量不会随着年龄的增长而强大吧？我猜，应该是智慧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17302D4DB9510805","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110510008:1":{"text":"Wisdom Keeper, what do you think? Did we guess right?","source_cn":"英灵前辈，如何？猜对了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31E3C9256455CF90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110510009:1":{"text":"That is correct. Now, for the second riddle.","source_cn":"正确无误。那么，第二道谜题——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07B19FD789C60CE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1110510010:1":{"text":"Sand grains scatter in the wind, but the desert as a whole remains untouched. Why is that?","source_cn":"单独的沙粒随风而散，整个的沙漠却不为风所动摇，这是因为什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21BF6F139E5B63CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1110510010":{"text":"Sand grains scatter in the wind, but the desert as a whole remains untouched. Why is that?","source_cn":"单独的沙粒随风而散，整个的沙漠却不为风所动摇，这是因为什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21BF6F139E5B63CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1110510011:1":{"text":"Although a strong will is important, I don't think that's the correct answer...","source_cn":"虽然也很重要啦，但感觉更像是团结合作？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A26829564A1C458","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110510013:1":{"text":"So did we get it right?","source_cn":"第二道题，我们答对了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90EADE0D24E31880","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1110510014:1":{"text":"Correct. Just like how sand is unmovable as a whole unit, unity and cooperation are vital for the survival for Maulers in the harsh desert.","source_cn":"正确无误。团结合作正是蛮血在这残酷沙漠中生存的唯一要义。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67FA2B2AD86D1CA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1110510015:1":{"text":"That is also what the Warsong Festival stands for, avoiding pointless internal strife and bloodshed...","source_cn":"这也是战歌节的初衷，远离无谓的内斗和流血……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62332299A7A844D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1110510016:1":{"text":"I perished in the turmoil of war long ago. I hope that my blood and tears serve as a warning to others.","source_cn":"我殒命于多年前的倾轧鏖战，希望我之血泪足以警世。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83CAFD2A37D9BDA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1110510017:1":{"text":"So that's what happened...","source_cn":"竟然是这样吗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C8C6C0EE2665768","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1110510018:1":{"text":"Now, for the final riddle.","source_cn":"试炼者们，现在还剩下最后一道谜题——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECEECF1AF51DB9AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1110510019:1":{"text":"I await in the center of a trap I set. Poisonous bites and sharp thorns instill fear in my prey, while my eight eyes observe their hurried movements. What am I?","source_cn":"我布下天罗地网，端坐在中央。毒咬和尖刺使猎物畏惧，八只...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8621E65A095BDDF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:22:1110510019":{"text":"I await in the center of a trap I set. Poisonous bites and sharp thorns instill fear in my prey, while my eight eyes observe their hurried movements. What am I?","source_cn":"我布下天罗地网，端坐在中央。毒咬和尖刺使猎物畏惧，八只眼睛窥视着他们急行。我是什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8621E65A095BDDF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1110510020:1":{"text":"Yes, it's gotta be a spider! It's so obvious!","source_cn":"对啊，谜底肯定是蜘蛛！太明显了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC078544B68D0CAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1110510022:1":{"text":"Simple? Challengers, let's not jump to conclusions.","source_cn":"简单？试炼者，切勿言之过早。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x242B0854B55797F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1110510023:1":{"text":"Hmph. Does this riddle lead to a battle in the end?","source_cn":"哼，无聊的谜题最后导向的还是战斗吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DB8E0231500BC02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1110510024:1":{"text":"If we were going to fight anyway, I would've rather we skipped the riddles and just got down to it.","source_cn":"那不如直接进行战斗，省去无谓的过程。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D9B5482257E241E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:22:0:1":{"text":"A spider!","source_cn":"蜘蛛？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBBD3144E0BC53867","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"A spider!","female":"A spider!","variant_male_record_index":"63574","variant_female_record_index":"63575","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1110510021:1":{"text":"Yeah, even I could figure it out! That was so simple!","source_cn":"没错，我都能猜出来……居然这么容易的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB38DEA7446BB5214","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:22:1:2":{"text":"Isn't this riddle way too easy?","source_cn":"这题是否太简单了？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0BFA12A1045EBA2E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Isn't this riddle way too easy?","female":"Isn't this riddle way too easy?","variant_male_record_index":"63576","variant_female_record_index":"63577","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:12:0:1":{"text":"Sand has a strong will.","source_cn":"顽强意志","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x18E5FE234C10B9DC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Sand has a strong will.","female":"Sand has a strong will.","variant_male_record_index":"63568","variant_female_record_index":"63569","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:12:1:2":{"text":"Because of their unity.","source_cn":"团结合作","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7D60917B25408E69","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Because of their unity.","female":"Because of their unity.","variant_male_record_index":"63570","variant_female_record_index":"63571","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1110510012:1":{"text":"Hm? I don't think that's the right answer, I think it must be about cooperation!","source_cn":"嗯？好像不太对，我猜是团结合作！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1BE1FE1AE930B32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:12:2:3":{"text":"Sand just goes with the flow.","source_cn":"随波逐流","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBE6A8EA68D0CB8CF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Sand just goes with the flow.","female":"Sand just goes with the flow.","variant_male_record_index":"63572","variant_female_record_index":"63573","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:0:1":{"text":"Strength","source_cn":"力量","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9212B3779D965FE3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Strength","female":"Strength","variant_male_record_index":"63562","variant_female_record_index":"63563","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1110510007:1":{"text":"Hmm... But glory only comes with consistent victories. I think the answer is wisdom!","source_cn":"得一直胜利了才会不断获得吧？看起来，只有智慧了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C20CB98CAD4A02E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:1:2":{"text":"Glory","source_cn":"荣耀","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8BE67F21B0C5D043","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Glory","female":"Glory","variant_male_record_index":"63564","variant_female_record_index":"63565","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:2:3":{"text":"Wisdom","source_cn":"智慧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBE2CF78EC283B890","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Wisdom","female":"Wisdom","variant_male_record_index":"63566","variant_female_record_index":"63567","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:智慧的英灵":{"text":"Wisdom Keeper","source":"智慧的英灵","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"Alsa","source":"阿尔萨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索恩":{"text":"Soren","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:赛特斯":{"text":"Seth","source":"赛特斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":36,"localized_text_count":35,"speaker_count":4}}